# Optional. Machine-local path to an OpenMAIC checkout, used by
# `npm run check:study-arena-drift` INSTEAD of fetching from GitHub.
#
# You do not need this file — without it the check fetches the pinned ref from
# raw.githubusercontent.com, which is what CI does. Set it when you want to run
# the check offline, or diff against a specific local revision.
#
# Copy to `.openmaic-repo` (gitignored) and edit. One line, no quotes.
# The directory must contain lib/orchestration/ or the check aborts.
#
# /Users/you/Development/OpenMAIC
